          "canonical_heading": "OVERVIEW",
          "content_blocks": [
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "An inherited myopathy of Labrador",
              "pdf_page": 1025,
              "printed_page": 943,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "retrievers.",
              "pdf_page": 1025,
              "printed_page": 943,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Recognized worldwide.",
              "pdf_page": 1025,
              "printed_page": 943,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Autosomal recessive mode of inheritance;",
              "pdf_page": 1025,
              "printed_page": 943,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "severity of clinical signs varies.",
              "pdf_page": 1025,
              "printed_page": 943,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "More recently classified as a centronuclear myopathy (CNM).",
              "pdf_page": 1025,
              "printed_page": 943,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "The causative genetic mutation has been identified—called protein tyrosine phosphataselike A gene (PTPLA). CNM-causing genes,",
              "pdf_page": 1025,
              "printed_page": 943,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "subheading",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "includingPTPLA, interact to build a functional",
              "pdf_page": 1025,
              "printed_page": 943,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "muscle and to maintain its homeostasis.",
              "pdf_page": 1025,
              "printed_page": 943,
              "column": 1,
              "subheading": "includingPTPLA, interact to build a functional"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Loss",
              "pdf_page": 1025,
              "printed_page": 943,
              "column": 1,
              "subheading": "includingPTPLA, interact to build a functional"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "of tendon reflexes and muscle histology—may",
              "pdf_page": 1025,
              "printed_page": 943,
              "column": 1,
              "subheading": "includingPTPLA, interact to build a functional"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "be more suggestive clinically of a neurogenic",
              "pdf_page": 1025,
              "printed_page": 943,
              "column": 1,
              "subheading": "includingPTPLA, interact to build a functional"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "than a myopathic cause without further testing.",
              "pdf_page": 1025,
              "printed_page": 943,
              "column": 1,
              "subheading": "includingPTPLA, interact to build a functional"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "No histologic abnormalities found in CNS or",
              "pdf_page": 1025,
              "printed_page": 943,
              "column": 1,
              "subheading": "includingPTPLA, interact to build a functional"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "peripheral nervous system (PNS).",
              "pdf_page": 1025,
              "printed_page": 943,
              "column": 1,
              "subheading": "includingPTPLA, interact to build a functional"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Studies",
              "pdf_page": 1025,
