    "DIAGNOSIS": {
      "present": true,
      "status": "content",
      "content_blocks": [],
      "subsections": {
        "DIFFERENTIAL DIAGNOSIS": {
          "present": true,
          "status": "content",
          "source_heading": "DIFFERENTIAL DIAGNOSIS",
          "canonical_heading": "DIFFERENTIAL DIAGNOSIS",
          "content_blocks": [
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "With little muscle atrophy—exercise intolerance may mimic signs of myasthenia gravis, cardiac or orthopedic disease.",
              "pdf_page": 1025,
              "printed_page": 943,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Exercise-induced collapse syndrome also recognized in this breed; however, not associated with muscle atrophy and collapse",
              "pdf_page": 1025,
              "printed_page": 943,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "seen only after strenuous exercise.",
              "pdf_page": 1025,
              "printed_page": 943,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "With marked muscle atrophy—consider other myopathies (infectious, immune-mediated, metabolic, congenital) and generalized lower",
              "pdf_page": 1025,
              "printed_page": 943,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "motor neuron disorders.",
              "pdf_page": 1025,
              "printed_page": 943,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Infectious myopathy due to congenital neospora caninum infection has a higher incidence in",
              "pdf_page": 1025,
              "printed_page": 943,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Labrador retrievers.",
              "pdf_page": 1025,
              "printed_page": 943,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Congenital muscular dystrophy in a male due to dystrophin deficiency and in a female due to sarcolemmal collagen deficiency myopathy have also been",
              "pdf_page": 1025,
              "printed_page": 943,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "reported in Labrador retrievers.",
              "pdf_page": 1025,
              "printed_page": 943,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "An X-linked myotubular myopathy (XLMTM), which is an unrelated CNM, due to a mutation in",
              "pdf_page": 1025,
              "printed_page": 943,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "subheading",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "MTM1gene, has also been identified in",
              "pdf_page": 1025,
              "printed_page": 943,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "young male Labrador retrievers. Affected dogs",
              "pdf_page": 1025,
              "printed_page": 943,
              "column": 2,
              "subheading": "MTM1gene, has also been identified in"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "show progressive and severe weakness and",
              "pdf_page": 1025,
              "printed_page": 943,
              "column": 2,
              "subheading": "MTM1gene, has also been identified in"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "muscle atrophy in the first 2 months of life",
              "pdf_page": 1025,
              "printed_page": 943,
              "column": 2,
              "subheading": "MTM1gene, has also been identified in"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "resulting in euthanasia before 6 months of age.",
              "pdf_page": 1025,
              "printed_page": 943,
              "column": 2,
              "subheading": "MTM1gene, has also been identified in"
            }
          ]
        },
